    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "support doesn't really change the math though. the time is still gone. i'm 45 and i have nothing to show for the last two decades. it's not just a \"difficult time,\" it's a total bankruptcy of my entire life's purpose. how am i supposed to just \"start over\" when the foundation i built everything on is completely obliterated? it feels like the game was rigged from the start and i just lost everything for zero return.",
